      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00068",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "转眼间，天已擦黑。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In the blink of an eye, it had already grown dark.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00068",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "“美代、美代”的微弱呼声，不时在黑夜的冷空气中颤动着。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The faint calls of \"Miyo, Miyo\" trembled now and then in the cold night air.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00068",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我在读书。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I was reading a book.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00068",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "美代每次去给祖父把尿的脚步声，我都能听见。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Each time Miyo went to help Grandfather urinate, I could hear her footsteps.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00068",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "不久，美代像是回家去了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Before long, Miyo seemed to have gone home.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00068",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "我给祖父喝茶。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I gave Grandfather some tea to drink.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
